%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: The Ugly Duckling, page 16: a swan
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 26 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
/cb-font /Palatino-Roman def /cb-fontit /Palatino-Italic def /cb-size 21 def /cb-grain 0 def   % paint covers the paper everywhere
cb-ground
/spring cb-season
330 cb-psky 330 cb-pwater
-9 621 330 70 cb-ptreeline
-10 620 334 cb-pmist
/cb-swbow true def /cb-dkface -1 def
gsave 0 300 translate 1 -1 scale 0 -300 translate 322 300 350 cb-swanswim grestore
newpath -9 0 630 300 cb-rect [0.56 0.74 0.90] 0.06 cb-bigwash
0 1 8 { /i exch def newpath 160 i 9 mul sub 280 i 26 mul sub moveto 300 i 14 mul add 0 rlineto /glint cb-pc cb-rgb << /Width 2 /Taper 0.6 >> pkliner } for
322 300 350 cb-swanswim
/cb-swbow false def /cb-dkface 1 def
cb-ink cb-rgb
(The duckling bowed his head too.) 60 572 492 /center cb-text pop
cb-fontit 30 cb-type (And there in the water was a swan.) 306 500 /center cb-say
16 cb-folio
showpage
